# Application Constants

Centralize reusable literals and defaults instead of scattering magic values.

## Preferred locations

- Runtime/config defaults: `src/core/settings/config.py` or `src/core/settings/constants.py`
- DB-related constants: `src/infrastructure/db/`
- Integration timeouts/retries: adapter modules under `src/infrastructure/`

## Rules

- Do not duplicate policy literals across business modules.
- Keep secrets out of constants files; read them from environment variables.

## Project Adaptation Notes

- Adapted for `P:\tarot` layered architecture.
